{"id":"60a2ae7d955cfe55","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-closed-comp-equiv-compat.md","title":"历史入口","display":"thm--closed-comp-equiv — 历史入口","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-closed-comp-equiv-compat","aliases":["16-thm-closed-comp-equiv-compat","16-thm--closed-comp-equiv"],"display":"thm--closed-comp-equiv — 历史入口","depends_on":["[[16-thm-closed-comp-equiv]]"],"source":"Theorem 10.5.5(ii), pp. 627–628 (PDF 647–648)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-closed-comp-equiv-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-closed-comp-equiv-compat</span><span>16-thm--closed-comp-equiv</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm--closed-comp-equiv — 历史入口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7d83daba15e3a054\" href=\"?note=7d83daba15e3a054\" title=\"16-thm-closed-comp-equiv\">16-thm-closed-comp-equiv</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Theorem 10.5.5(ii), pp. 627–628 (PDF 647–648)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为有限极限范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cod}:\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(\\operatorname{cod}:\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LCCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{LCCC}\\)</span> 及证明见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d83daba15e3a054\" href=\"?note=7d83daba15e3a054\" title=\"16-thm-closed-comp-equiv\">16-thm-closed-comp-equiv</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(\\operatorname{cod},\\operatorname{Id})\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{LCCC}(\\mathcal B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(\\operatorname{cod},\\operatorname{Id})\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{LCCC}(\\mathcal B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>与规范定理同一参数和结论；不再重复一般理解结构上未经成立的三项等价。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Theorem 10.5.5(ii), pp. 627–628 (PDF 647–648)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-thm-closed-comp-equiv","status":"resolved","id":"7d83daba15e3a054","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-closed-comp-equiv]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-closed-comp-equiv","status":"resolved","id":"7d83daba15e3a054","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B$ 为有限极限范畴，$\\operatorname{cod}:\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\to\\mathcal B$；$\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}$、$\\mathrm{LCCC}$ 及证明见 [[16-thm-closed-comp-equiv]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cod}:\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LCCC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(\\operatorname{cod},\\operatorname{Id})\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{LCCC}(\\mathcal B).","display":true}],"bytes":992,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-401","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-closed-comp-equiv-compat|thm--closed-comp-equiv — 历史入口]]"}],"outgoing":["7d83daba15e3a054"]}